WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.673
Unit five. Weather and Seasons!

2
00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:12.680
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Elementary level!

3
00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:16.710
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.767
Today we learn: Weather and Seasons. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.466 --> 00:00:25.433
Temperature. Say it with me. Temperature!

6
00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:32.563
Humid. Say it with me. Humid!

7
00:00:36.063 --> 00:00:40.263
Forecast. Say it with me. Forecast!

8
00:00:43.765 --> 00:00:47.598
Sunny. Say it with me. Sunny!

9
00:00:51.094 --> 00:00:54.811
Storm. Say it with me. Storm!

10
00:00:58.336 --> 00:01:02.169
Seasonal. Say it with me. Seasonal!

11
00:01:05.653 --> 00:01:09.453
Chilly. Say it with me. Chilly!

12
00:01:12.952 --> 00:01:17.169
Umbrella. Say it with me. Umbrella!

13
00:01:20.649 --> 00:01:24.399
Breezy. Say it with me. Breezy!

14
00:01:27.911 --> 00:01:32.311
Overcast. Say it with me. Overcast!

15
00:01:35.902 --> 00:01:46.013
Grammar time! Present continuous for now. Listen. It is raining now. The temperature is dropping.

16
00:01:46.063 --> 00:01:52.252
Your turn. Say it with me. It is raining now. The temperature is dropping.

17
00:01:57.095 --> 00:02:04.384
The forecast said it would be humid and sunny, but a sudden storm made it chilly. I was glad I brought my umbrella.

18
00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:05.823
I like this story!

19
00:02:06.987 --> 00:02:12.495
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:12.545 --> 00:02:13.695
Forecast!

21
00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:20.011
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:20.061 --> 00:02:21.211
Chilly!

23
00:02:22.132 --> 00:02:30.619
Think and answer. What is the weather like in your favorite season?

24
00:02:30.669 --> 00:02:31.819
Great answer!

25
00:02:33.034 --> 00:02:37.424
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:37.474 --> 00:02:39.112
Goodbye, everyone!

